1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:06,098
Geed yar oo ku dheggan buuraha Soomaaliya… waagii hore qiimihiisu wuxuu la mid ahaa dahab. Waayo?

2
00:00:06,198 --> 00:00:12,534
Waa geedka beeyada. Marka jirridda si yar loo jaro, dheecaan ayaa ka soo baxa oo engega. Taasi waa beeyada.

3
00:00:12,634 --> 00:00:18,445
Wuxuu ku baxaa dhul engegan oo dhagax ah, inta badan buuraha waqooyiga Soomaaliya, meel dalagyo kale aysan ku noolaan karin.

4
00:00:18,545 --> 00:00:25,166
Laba nooc ayaa caan ah: Beeyo iyo Meydi. Meydiga waxaa loogu yeeraa 'boqorka beeyada', wuxuuna ka baxaa Soomaaliya oo keliya.

5
00:00:25,266 --> 00:00:33,505
Kumanaan sano ayaa laga ganacsanayay. Masaaridii hore waxay beeyo ka keeni jireen 'Dhulka Punt', oo taariikhyahanno badan ay rumaysan yihiin inuu ahaa Geeska Afrika.

6
00:00:33,605 --> 00:00:37,724
Maanta waxaa loo isticmaalaa uunsiga, cadarka iyo daawooyinka dhaqameed adduunka oo dhan.

7
00:00:37,824 --> 00:00:44,899
Laakiin geedaha ayaa khatar ku jira. Haddii si xad-dhaaf ah loo jaro, geedku wuxuu u baahan karaa toban sano ama ka badan si uu u bogsado.

8
00:00:44,999 --> 00:00:49,184
Ma ilaalin doonnaa dahabkeenna? Adiga, gurigiinna beeyo ma lagu shidaa?
